Hi all!

Emma and I conceived, and Emma drew, a beautiful mascot (a pair of,
to be precise) for the Linux Man Pages.  The image is attached in a
tarball to this mail.  :-)

Those who attend the Kernel Recipes conference may find the style
familiar.  Emma is the author of the Kernel Recipes' mascots.

If you see me in conferences, I'll bring stickers!

I haven't included the image in the man-pages.git repository, since
binary blobs have shown to be useful in attacks such as the xz-backdoor.
You can find it in this email, and I also used it in the website.


Have a lovely summer!
Alex

--=20
<https://www.alejandro-colomar.es>

--myc3kqal4maw542v
